WEBVTT

00:00:10.346 --> 00:00:12.348
(ADVENTUROUS MUSIC CONTINUES)

00:00:13.432 --> 00:00:15.476
(BOTH WHOOPING)

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:16.685
(LAUGHS)

00:00:16.769 --> 00:00:17.770
(GASPS)

00:00:20.606 --> 00:00:21.982
(YELLING)

00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:23.943
Yeah! Whoo!

00:00:30.658 --> 00:00:32.076
(LUCA GASPS)

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:33.244
Whoa.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.788
(LUCA GASPS)

00:00:35.871 --> 00:00:38.082
(GASPS) Papà, what's that?

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:41.836
How do we get in?

00:00:44.255 --> 00:00:46.131
(WHISTLING MELODY)

00:00:46.215 --> 00:00:47.591
(LUCA AND ALBERTO GRUNTING)

00:00:55.182 --> 00:00:56.517
This will be a breeze.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.352
-Just don't get wet.
-Uh...

00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:05.317
(GASPS)

00:01:07.194 --> 00:01:09.071
Actually, this town seems
a little crowded.

00:01:09.155 --> 00:01:10.823
Hey! Silenzio, Bruno.

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:12.700
What's wrong with you, stupido?

00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:13.784
MAN: Huh?

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:15.411
(MAN SCOFFS)

00:01:15.494 --> 00:01:16.787
-Huh! It worked.
-See?

00:01:17.121 --> 00:01:19.165
You just gotta follow my lead.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.294
(PEOPLE CHATTERING INDISTINCTLY)

00:01:31.302 --> 00:01:32.636
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:33.762
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:01:43.022 --> 00:01:44.023
(SPEAKS ITALIAN)

00:01:44.106 --> 00:01:45.149
-(MAN LAUGHS)
-(PLAYER GROANS)

00:01:47.902 --> 00:01:50.112
Classic human town. Pretty cool, right?

00:01:50.196 --> 00:01:51.989
Hey, you do it now. Just say the thing.

00:01:52.907 --> 00:01:53.908
BOTH: Mmm.

00:01:53.991 --> 00:01:55.576
(CHUCKLES LIGHTLY) Madams,

00:01:55.659 --> 00:01:57.411
what's wrong with you, stupido?

00:01:57.495 --> 00:01:58.496
(BOTH GASP)

00:01:58.579 --> 00:02:00.456
-(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)
-(BOTH GRUNT)

00:02:01.248 --> 00:02:02.625
(BOTH GROAN)

00:02:05.794 --> 00:02:07.213
Maybe I said it wrong?

00:02:07.296 --> 00:02:08.547
Mmm. Mmm!

00:02:11.967 --> 00:02:12.968
Wow!

00:02:13.511 --> 00:02:14.512
Mmm!

00:02:16.055 --> 00:02:17.139
(SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:17.223 --> 00:02:18.432
(GASPS)

00:02:20.059 --> 00:02:21.310
(WHIMPERING)

00:02:23.062 --> 00:02:25.523
Alberto, this is too dangerous.

00:02:25.689 --> 00:02:27.066
Let's get out of here.

00:02:27.525 --> 00:02:28.567
-And go where?
-(GASPS)

00:02:28.651 --> 00:02:31.070
(UPBEAT ITALIAN POP MUSIC
PLAYING OVER RADIO)

00:02:33.656 --> 00:02:34.657
-(GASPS)
-Whoa.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:35.908
It's Signor Vespa!

00:02:35.991 --> 00:02:38.160
-(ENGINE REVVING)
-(MUSIC CONTINUES PLAYING)

00:02:38.244 --> 00:02:39.954
Mannaggia! Here we go.

00:02:40.037 --> 00:02:41.080
(GREETS IN ITALIAN)

00:02:41.163 --> 00:02:43.791
Oh, mamma mia! Please, no more revving.

00:02:43.874 --> 00:02:45.459
(COMPLAINS IN ITALIAN)

00:02:45.543 --> 00:02:47.044
Ciao! Ciao!

00:02:47.127 --> 00:02:48.212
(BOTH PANTING)

00:02:48.671 --> 00:02:50.631
-(GASPS EXCITEDLY)
-Beep, beep!

00:02:50.714 --> 00:02:53.676
Pride of Portorosso coming through!

00:02:53.759 --> 00:02:55.261
-Ciao, belle!
-WOMAN: Hmm, blech!

00:02:55.344 --> 00:02:56.679
You're making me blush.

00:02:58.806 --> 00:03:02.726
And now, who wants to watch me
eat a big sandwich? Hmm?

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.771
(CHUCKLES) There it is.

00:03:05.855 --> 00:03:07.940
That's how we're gonna see the world.

00:03:08.023 --> 00:03:09.608
Hey, little help?

00:03:12.236 --> 00:03:13.237
KID 1: Huh?
KID 2: Hmm?

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.738
(SHOUTS IN ITALIAN)

00:03:14.822 --> 00:03:15.990
(ALL GASP)

00:03:16.073 --> 00:03:17.116
(EXCLAIMS IN ITALIAN)

00:03:17.408 --> 00:03:18.409
(GRUNTS)

00:03:18.492 --> 00:03:20.744
Oh, mamma mia!
Talk to Ercole. Are you hurt?

00:03:20.828 --> 00:03:21.829
Well, my head kinda hurts...

00:03:21.912 --> 00:03:24.081
Not you, Ciccio! Out of the way!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:28.043
Oh, piccolina, if there is
so much as a scratch...

00:03:28.127 --> 00:03:29.170
(SIGHS IN RELIEF)

00:03:29.253 --> 00:03:31.714
Someone got lucky today. Hmm?

00:03:31.797 --> 00:03:33.007
Who got lucky?

00:03:35.259 --> 00:03:37.636
Mm-hmm. Out-of-towners, eh?

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.305
Let me welcome you.

00:03:39.638 --> 00:03:42.057
(WELCOMING IN ITALIAN)

00:03:42.141 --> 00:03:43.184
-Ciccio?
-(GASPS)

00:03:43.267 --> 00:03:46.437
I am delighted to meet you,
Number One and Number Two.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.522
I love your stylish clothes.

00:03:48.606 --> 00:03:51.525
Where did you get them?
A dead body? (LAUGHING)

00:03:51.609 --> 00:03:52.610
(SNICKERS) Dead body.

00:03:52.693 --> 00:03:53.694
I'm kidding.

00:03:53.777 --> 00:03:55.863
Uh... Look, Signor Vespa...

00:03:55.946 --> 00:03:58.199
Signor Vespa? (LAUGHING)

00:03:58.282 --> 00:03:59.492
-This guy funny, hmm?
-(LAUGHS)

00:03:59.575 --> 00:04:01.035
I am Ercole Visconti.

00:04:01.118 --> 00:04:03.412
Five-time winner of the Portorosso Cup.

00:04:03.579 --> 00:04:05.080
The Portorosso what?

00:04:05.164 --> 00:04:06.457
The Portorosso Cup!

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:07.541
(EXCLAIMS IN ITALIAN)

00:04:07.625 --> 00:04:10.294
How do you think
I paid for my beautiful Vespa?

00:04:12.463 --> 00:04:13.714
-Hey, stop looking.
-(LUCA GASPS)

00:04:13.797 --> 00:04:14.798
She's too beautiful for you.

00:04:15.174 --> 00:04:17.551
-I, uh...
-(IMITATES LUCA MOCKINGLY)

00:04:17.635 --> 00:04:19.261
(LAUGHS) I love it.

00:04:19.345 --> 00:04:21.055
The little guy can't even get a word out.

00:04:21.138 --> 00:04:24.767
Oof. And he smells like behind
the pescheria. (SCOFFS)

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.519
Hey, my friend smells amazing.

00:04:26.602 --> 00:04:28.938
Sorry, sorry. I'll make it up to him.

00:04:29.021 --> 00:04:30.898
-Ciccio, Guido.
-(ALBERTO GRUNTING)

00:04:30.981 --> 00:04:31.982
What are you doing?

00:04:32.066 --> 00:04:33.067
-ALBERTO: Luca!
-Alberto!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.276
Ah, just a little bath.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.694
-LUCA: Oh, no, no, no!
-It's funny.

00:04:35.778 --> 00:04:37.279
-Huh?
-(GRUNTING)

00:04:37.363 --> 00:04:38.823
(ERCOLE LAUGHING)

00:04:38.906 --> 00:04:40.324
-No!
-Huh?

00:04:40.407 --> 00:04:42.284
Hey! Ercole, basta!

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.746
Oh, look who's here. Spewlia.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.998
(CHUCKLES) Wow.
That's how you're training for the race?

00:04:48.082 --> 00:04:49.083
(REPLIES IN ITALIAN)

00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:50.417
Your reign of terror is

00:04:50.501 --> 00:04:52.127
-coming to an end!
-ERCOLE: "Coming to an end."

00:04:52.211 --> 00:04:53.379
You mean like a year ago?

00:04:53.462 --> 00:04:55.047
When you quit in the middle of the race?

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.967
Because you couldn't stop
(GAGS) throwing up?

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:00.302
I didn't quit. They made me stop.

00:05:00.636 --> 00:05:02.763
I think that is worse. Now, go away.

00:05:02.847 --> 00:05:04.223
I'm having fun with my new friends.

00:05:04.306 --> 00:05:05.307
They're coming with me.

00:05:06.183 --> 00:05:08.978
Hop on. I could use the extra weight.

00:05:09.061 --> 00:05:10.062
(BLOWS RASPBERRIES)

00:05:10.145 --> 00:05:12.690
Fine. Go start a club. For losers!

00:05:12.773 --> 00:05:13.774
(ALL LAUGH)

00:05:13.858 --> 00:05:16.485
Maggiore! Another sighting.
In the harbor, this time.

00:05:16.569 --> 00:05:18.821
I know. We are setting up a reward.

00:05:18.904 --> 00:05:20.906
Someone's gonna win a nice prize.

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:22.616
(GASPS) Me! Me! I win the prizes.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:23.701
-Ciccio!
-(GASPS)

00:05:23.784 --> 00:05:24.827
Get your daddy's harpoon!

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.954
We're gonna catch a sea monster.

00:05:27.037 --> 00:05:28.164
-Sì!
-(EXCLAIMS EXCITEDLY)

00:05:28.247 --> 00:05:30.416
Sto imbecille thinks he can be a jerk

00:05:30.499 --> 00:05:31.500
'cause he keeps winning the race,

00:05:31.584 --> 00:05:33.085
which he shouldn't even
get to do anymore,

00:05:33.169 --> 00:05:35.296
'cause he's too old
and too much of a jerk!

00:05:35.379 --> 00:05:36.547
(LAUGHS SHEEPISHLY)

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:38.090
You know, we underdogs

00:05:38.174 --> 00:05:39.550
have to look out for each other, right?

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:41.093
What's under the dogs?

00:05:41.552 --> 00:05:42.553
Underdogs.

00:05:42.636 --> 00:05:44.096
You know, kids who are different,

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.181
dressed weird,

00:05:45.264 --> 00:05:47.474
or a little sweatier than average.

00:05:47.558 --> 00:05:48.642
Uh...

00:05:48.726 --> 00:05:50.311
Too much? Too much.

00:05:50.644 --> 00:05:52.688
So, are you in town for the race?

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:55.608
The Portorosso Cup?

00:05:57.485 --> 00:05:59.028
Well, good talk.

00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:02.531
I gotta deliver these.
Always be training, you know?

00:06:03.908 --> 00:06:06.619
(GASPS) We should ask her
about this Portorosso Cup race.

00:06:06.702 --> 00:06:09.413
That's how the loud scary human said
he got his Vespa.

